<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aries Packaging yr shr slips, ups div.</title>
<headline>Aries Packaging yr shr slips, ups div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     34.3	  vs 35.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 11.0	  vs 10.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   3.78	  vs 3.92</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.23	  vs 2.39</p>
<p>    Interest		  0.49	  vs 0.07</p>
<p>    Turnover		  42.30	 vs 41.80</p>
<p>Div payable March 27</p>
<p>on register March 14</p>
<p>Full name: Aries Packaging Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Aries Packaging said  the results allowed it finance current projects aimed at broadening the base of its packaging interests.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
